WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.716
You can generate a thousand articles with AI today. Most of it is slop — generic, off-brand, forgettable. Volume is easy. Voice is hard.

00:08.716 --> 00:18.922
I build the content engine: a brief goes in, an on-brand piece comes out — grounded in your facts, your voice, and your style, at the scale you actually need.

00:18.922 --> 00:28.757
The hard part is quality at volume. So I build the guardrails: brand voice locked, facts checked, and a review gate that kills the slop before it ever publishes.

00:28.757 --> 00:36.501
Then I measure it: on-brand score, fact-check pass rate, and pieces shipped — so scale never costs you your reputation.

00:36.501 --> 00:40.942
Content at scale that still sounds like you. Let's build your engine.

